# dev-only: union-merges CHANGELOG.md across topic branches (fork build
# tooling; this file lives only on the throwaway `dev` branch and is never
# merged upstream). Every topic branch is expected to append its own
# bullet under CHANGELOG's shared "## [Main branch]" section, which would
# otherwise conflict on every multi-branch assembly; union merge keeps
# every side's added lines instead.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
